{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:05:12.780Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff048-86cc-7773-9688-f836d6ffad64","call_id":"call_J19upvIpcyYfZWxnOsnYh1vZ","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\n\ntest/opentui-host.test.ts:\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > answers RPC dialogs instead of cancelling Pi extension UI [2.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > turns finished tool results into generative cards [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > activates a canonical OpenUI document carried by a real tool result [2.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > hydrates the existing session and publishes header state\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > exposes model, thinking, session, and abort controls to the host [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > resumes, renames, clones, and forks through the real Pi RPC session operations [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > keeps the active session when switching is cancelled or a rename is empty\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > shows sanitized tool failures instead of silently dropping them\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > explicitly answers unsupported custom UI requests [2.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > renders every serializable UI document family with a generic fallback\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > presents a focused canonical document with discoverable controls for every terminal action [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > constructs and dispatches the exact canonical choice action through the injected seam [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > cancel keeps the focused document and sends no action [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > retains a failed action and retries its exact payload and idempotency key\n(pass) OpenTUI host controller > creates the canonical retry action for a failed document [1.00ms]\n(pass) plain terminal cards > keep a stable width and render search citations\n\ntest/tui-view-model.test.ts:\n(pass) TUI view model > hydrates user, assistant, artifact, and failure entries from RPC history [1.00ms]\n(pass) TUI view model > sanitizes and bounds runtime diagnostics\n(pass) TUI view model > summarizes header state and only shows the activity rail when there is room\n\ntest/tui-ui.test.ts:\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > accepts the full current versioned fixture and presents every canonical node safely [1.00ms]\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > imports legacy keating.ui tool results and recovers malformed or browser-program input without evaluation\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > validates all practical action families, preserves retry work, and returns completed revision/lifecycle results [36.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > replays an exact receipt and turns key reuse with changed work into a recoverable conflict [1.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > resumes an exact durable pending receipt after restart, then replays its final result [1.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > re-dispatches an exact retryable receipt, then durably replays the accepted result [1.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > returns recovery rather than dropping invalid or stale entered work\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes sibling actions for one document without losing either receipt [7.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > surfaces storage failures as recoverable outcomes before delivery\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > persists owner-only receipts atomically and replays them after a process restart [7.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes two filesystem store instances across the complete dispatch transaction [30.00ms]\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > tightens pre-existing directory permissions and rejects symlinked journals [1.00ms]\n\ntest/tui-rpc-action-transport.test.ts:\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > round-trips only bounded, correlated shared-contract envelopes [1.00ms]\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > dispatches through the public prompt/notify path and validates the ACK [2.00ms]\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > returns typed retryable recovery for missing receiver, busy runtime, and ACK timeout [4.00ms]\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > receiver materializes notes, persists a separate idempotent ledger, and replays exactly [6.00ms]\n\ntest/pty-rpc-client.test.ts:\n(pass) KeatingPtyRpcClient > uses Pi's public JSONL protocol inside a PTY [2.00ms]\n(pass) KeatingPtyRpcClient > forwards events and preserves extension dialog request ids [2.00ms]\n\ntest/tui-terminal-presentation.test.ts:\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > detects truecolor, indexed, basic, no-color, Unicode, and ASCII deterministically\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > projects exact 80x24, 100x30, and 140x40 layouts without color-only meaning\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > preserves the shared fixture while labeling terminal-only extensions and targets [1.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > renders the real shared fixture through OpenTUI MarkdownRenderable at 80 columns [42.00ms]\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > restores and retries the exact learner draft without mutating it\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > uses the follow-up transport while busy and reports an empty retry truthfully [1.00ms]\n\ntest/tui-session-browser.test.ts:\n(pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > sorts recent sessions, marks the active session, and exposes lineage without path leakage\n(pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > keeps session and turn-fork actions explicit and terminal-bounded\n\ntest/bun-handoff.test.ts:\n(pass) standalone OpenTUI Bun handoff > prefers the private release runtime and forwards the complete CLI invocation\n(pass) standalone OpenTUI Bun handoff > falls back to PATH and reports a truthful unavailable result\n\n 47 pass\n 0 fail\n 222 expect() calls\nRan 47 tests across 8 files. [417.00ms]\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"7237b642-49e1-4cb7-8a12-bea4d7047d25"}}}
