{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:14:11.399Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff050-bec7-7083-8436-3d288088d87a","call_id":"call_jUCLVyGKcwLTvxD7D7QUbf12","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Direct web BYOK requests to Tinker will fail CORS; route through the validated constrained relay, not a client-direct endpoint [Task 1]\n- Streaming work was interrupted and hosted Convex generation may still use `generateText`. Verify BYOK and hosted paths independently before claiming users see incremental text [Task 2]\n- Build/test evidence is insufficient for folio UX: run new-folio creation, cancellation, switching, and persistence in a live browser [Task 3]\n\n# Task Group: /home/diogenes/Projects/keating UI streaming, realtime A/V, and OpenUI learning flows\nscope: Keating Storybook-led UI cleanup, image/animation/code streaming previews, provider capability tiers, live-session fixes, and OpenUI study-plan architecture.\napplies_to: cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating; reuse_rule=reuse for Keating web UI/runtime work; treat API-backed realtime and chat-renderer coverage as unverified unless separately exercised.\n\n## Task 1: Clean learning UI and add image, animation, and code streaming previews\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/08/01/rollout-2026-08-01T17-01-40-019fbf21-f09f-7430-9d67-c1267e8285ed.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-31T08:46:26+00:00, thread_id=019fbf21-f09f-7430-9d67-c1267e8285ed, partial; chat code blocks remain unwired)\n\n### keywords\n\n- Storybook, negative-space, QuizRenderer, QuestionRenderer, image_generation.partial_image, partial_images, image-stream.ts, toolcall_delta, tool-arg-stream.ts, RunnableCodeBlock, NodePod\n\n## Task 2: Model realtime capability tiers and deploy live-session fixes\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T21-23-32-019fb5c4-fa04-7ce2-8e3a-42b93aef3ba2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-30T18:48:44+00:00, thread_id=019fb5c4-fa04-7ce2-8e3a-42b93aef3ba2, success; real API calls unverified)\n- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T22-32-08-019fb603-c694-75c2-8eb0-60484a5fca94.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-31T02:48:49+00:00, thread_id=019fb603-c694-75c2-8eb0-60484a5fca94, success; dirty worktree)\n\n### keywords\n\n- gemini-live, gpt-realtime, WebRTC, sampled JPEG, AudioWorklet, StandaloneLiveAgentBridge, Railway, keating.help/live, zero-gain node\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
