 Gemini Live is full audio/video duplex while GPT Realtime is audio duplex with image input -> model/test capability tiers instead of hardcoding provider assumptions [Task 2]\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
