{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:15:10.339Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff051-a503-73b2-bf5f-3cd48c0df3a4","call_id":"call_D5DX108Ns4GfZVSXGnq4RTEh","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"4988ae\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.185695836,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":290,\"output\":\"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\\n\\ntest/tui-product-surfaces.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI Library > previews text, exports a copy, and moves deletion to recoverable project trash [6.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > discovers generated cards, labels estimated topic urgency, and persists canonical SRS ratings [10.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > surfaces a corrupt schedule without overwriting it [2.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Settings > maps real RPC settings while keeping code augmentation capability truthful\\n\\ntest/tui-view-model.test.ts:\\n(pass) TUI view model > hydrates user, assistant, artifact, and failure entries from RPC history [2.00ms]\\n(pass) TUI view model > sanitizes and bounds runtime diagnostics\\n(pass) TUI view model > summarizes header state and only shows the activity rail when there is room\\n\\ntest/tui-session-browser.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > sorts recent sessions, marks the active session, and exposes lineage without path leakage\\n(pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > keeps session and turn-fork actions explicit and terminal-bounded [1.00ms]\\n\\n 9 pass\\n 0 fail\\n 39 expect() calls\\nRan 9 tests across 3 files. [255.00ms]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
