{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:16:45.483Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff053-18ab-79b1-9e4f-14eecd9cf4ef","call_id":"call_Vk1GhNSCZAPes9Fe5IRlY4b2","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"e6d135\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.277872822,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1142,\"output\":\"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\\n\\ntest/tui-terminal-presentation.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > detects truecolor, indexed, basic, no-color, Unicode, and ASCII deterministically\\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > projects exact 80x24, 100x30, and 140x40 layouts without color-only meaning\\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > preserves the shared fixture while labeling terminal-only extensions and targets [1.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > renders the real shared fixture through OpenTUI MarkdownRenderable at 80 columns [40.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > restores and retries the exact learner draft without mutating it [2.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > uses the follow-up transport while busy and reports an empty retry truthfully\\n\\ntest/tui-ui.test.ts:\\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > accepts the full current versioned fixture and presents every canonical node safely [2.00ms]\\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > imports legacy keating.ui tool results and recovers malformed or browser-program input without evaluation\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > validates all practical action families, preserves retry work, and returns completed revision/lifecycle results [33.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > replays an exact receipt and turns key reuse with changed work into a recoverable conflict [2.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > resumes an exact durable pending receipt after restart, then replays its final result [1.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > re-dispatches an exact retryable receipt, then durably replays the accepted result [1.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > returns recovery rather than dropping invalid or stale entered work\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes sibling actions for one document without losing either receipt [7.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > surfaces storage failures as recoverable outcomes before delivery [1.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > persists owner-only receipts atomically and replays them after a process restart [6.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes two filesystem store instances across the complete dispatch transaction [29.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > tightens pre-existing directory permissions and rejects symlinked journals [1.00ms]\\n\\ntest/tui-rpc-action-transport.test.ts:\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > round-trips only bounded, correlated shared-contract envelopes [2.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > dispatches through the public prompt/notify path and validates the ACK [1.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > returns typed retryable recovery for missing receiver, busy runtime, and ACK timeout [4.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > receiver materializes notes, persists a separate idempotent ledger, and replays exactly [5.00ms]\\n\\npackages/learner-contracts/test/rendering-fixtures.test.ts:\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > is versioned, unique, and contains every declared family\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > keeps the reference Markdown and browser OpenUI source explicit\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > validates a canonical JSON document with every shared node kind\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > keeps every positive document valid, nested, and globally id-distinct [1.00ms]\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > keeps bounded recovery cases valid and rejects declared invalid wire documents\\n(pass) cross-surface rendering fixture contract > declares source recovery, lifecycle, and theme scenarios without runtime dependencies\\n\\npackages/learner-contracts/test/openui-source.test.ts:\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > compiles fixture pack v2 through every registered component mapper [4.00ms]\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > accepts the browser object form without evaluating it\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > matches the browser root lifecycle default\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > classifies partial, malformed, unsafe, and future source distinctly\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > never evaluates model-authored expressions or HTML\\n(pass) trusted OpenUI source compiler > uses caller-owned session scope without cross-session identity reuse\\n\\n 34 pass\\n 0 fail\\n 217 expect() calls\\nRan 34 tests across 5 files. [342.00ms]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
