ss) Pi canonical UI action transport > returns typed retryable recovery for missing receiver, busy runtime, and ACK timeout [4.00ms]\\n  (pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > receiver materializes notes, persists a separate idempotent ledger, and replays exactly [7.00ms]\\n  \\n  test/tui-session-browser.test.ts:\\n  (pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > sorts recent sessions, marks the active session, and exposes lineage without path leakage\\n  (pass) OpenTUI session browser presentation > keeps session and turn-fork actions explicit and terminal-bounded\\n  \\n  test/tui-terminal-presentation.test.ts:\\n  (pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > detects truecolor, indexed, basic, no-color, Unicode, and ASCII deterministically\\n  (pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > projects exact 80x24, 100x30, and 140x40 layouts without color-only meaning\\n  (pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > preserves the shared fixture while labeling terminal-only extensions and targets [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > renders the real shared fixture through OpenTUI MarkdownRenderable at 80 columns [43.00ms]\\n  (pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > restores and retries the exact learner draft without mutating it [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > uses the follow-up transport while busy and reports an empty retry truthfully\\n  \\n  test/tui-ui.test.ts:\\n  (pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > accepts the full current versioned fixture and presents every canonical node safely [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > imports legacy keating.ui tool results and recovers malformed or browser-program input without evaluation\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > validates all practical action families, preserves retry work, and returns completed revision/lifecycle results [29.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > replays an exact receipt and turns key reuse with changed work into a recoverable conflict [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > resumes an exact durable pending receipt after restart, then replays its final result [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > re-dispatches an exact retryable receipt, then durably replays the accepted result [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > returns recovery rather than dropping invalid or stale entered work\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes sibling actions for one document without losing either receipt [9.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > surfaces storage failures as recoverable outcomes before delivery\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > persists owner-only receipts atomically and replays them after a process restart [4.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes two filesystem store instances across the complete dispatch transaction [31.00ms]\\n  (pass) durable shared UI action journal > tightens pre-existing directory permissions and rejects symlinked journals [1.00ms]\\n  \\n  test/tui-view-model.test.ts:\\n  (pass) TUI view model > hydrates user, assistant, artifact, and failure entries from RPC history\\n  (pass) TUI view model > sanitizes and bounds runtime diagnostics\\n  (pass) TUI view model > summarizes header state and only shows the activity rail when there is room\\n  (pass) TUI view model > exposes the connected product surfaces through the command catalog [1.00ms]\\n  \\n  test/util.test.ts:\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: clamp returns value within [min, max] [2.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: clamp is idempotent\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: clamp returns min for NaN\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: clamp returns min for non-finite values (NaN, Infinity, -Infinity)\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: clamp default range is [0, 1]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: mean of empty array is 0 [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: mean of single element is approximately that element\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: mean of values in [0,1] is in [0,1]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: slugify output contains only lowercase and hyphens [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: slugify never starts or ends with hyphen\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: slugify is idempotent [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: slugify returns non-empty string for non-empty input\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: titleCase capitalizes first letter of each word [2.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: chunk preserves all elements\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: chunk size does not exceed requested size [1.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: formatPercent returns string ending with %\\n  \\n  test/verification.test.ts:\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: topicContentHash is deterministic [6.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: topicContentHash produces different hashes for different topics [9.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: topicContentHash is 16 characters (hex prefix of sha256) [5.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: extractClaims produces non-empty output for topics with content [4.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: all extracted claims are non-empty strings [4.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: buildVerificationChecklist is non-empty and contains topic title [5.00ms]\\n  (pass) ALWAYS: buildPendingVerificationResult has unconfirmed claims [6.00ms]\\n  \\n  test/web-help.test.ts:\\n  (pass) web CLI help > explains every execution mode with actionable commands\\n  (pass) web CLI help > documents the external protocol and host trust boundary\\n  \\n   305 pass\\n   0 fail\\n   86748 expect() calls\\n  Ran 305 tests across 44 files. [8.92s]\\n{}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
