{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:20:12.556Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff056-418c-7e33-9b62-baf84739e56f","call_id":"call_I0c5hDDmT5cufvRixr7jzKAh","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"37033d\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.570691115,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1041,\"output\":\"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\\n\\ntest/tui-shell-handoff.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI classic Pi handoff > reopens the exact active Pi session\\n(pass) OpenTUI classic Pi handoff > does not invent context when no session exists\\n\\ntest/tui-product-surfaces.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI Library > previews text, exports a copy, and moves deletion to recoverable project trash [7.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > discovers generated cards, labels estimated topic urgency, and persists canonical SRS ratings [14.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > surfaces a corrupt schedule without overwriting it [1.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Settings > maps real RPC settings while keeping code augmentation capability truthful [1.00ms]\\n\\ntest/tui-view-model.test.ts:\\n(pass) TUI view model > hydrates user, assistant, artifact, and failure entries from RPC history [2.00ms]\\n(pass) TUI view model > sanitizes and bounds runtime diagnostics\\n(pass) TUI view model > summarizes header state and only shows the activity rail when there is room [1.00ms]\\n(pass) TUI view model > exposes the connected product surfaces through the command catalog\\n\\ntest/tui-terminal-presentation.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > detects truecolor, indexed, basic, no-color, Unicode, and ASCII deterministically [1.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI terminal capability and layout profiles > projects exact 80x24, 100x30, and 140x40 layouts without color-only meaning\\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > preserves the shared fixture while labeling terminal-only extensions and targets\\n(pass) OpenTUI semantic Markdown > renders the real shared fixture through OpenTUI MarkdownRenderable at 80 columns [44.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > restores and retries the exact learner draft without mutating it\\n(pass) OpenTUI failed-prompt recovery > uses the follow-up transport while busy and reports an empty retry truthfully\\n\\ntest/tui-ui.test.ts:\\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > accepts the full current versioned fixture and presents every canonical node safely [3.00ms]\\n(pass) shared terminal UI document adapter and presentation > imports legacy keating.ui tool results and recovers malformed or browser-program input without evaluation\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > validates all practical action families, preserves retry work, and returns completed revision/lifecycle results [36.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > replays an exact receipt and turns key reuse with changed work into a recoverable conflict [1.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > resumes an exact durable pending receipt after restart, then replays its final result [2.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > re-dispatches an exact retryable receipt, then durably replays the accepted result [1.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > returns recovery rather than dropping invalid or stale entered work\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes sibling actions for one document without losing either receipt [7.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > surfaces storage failures as recoverable outcomes before delivery\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > persists owner-only receipts atomically and replays them after a process restart [4.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > serializes two filesystem store instances across the complete dispatch transaction [29.00ms]\\n(pass) durable shared UI action journal > tightens pre-existing directory permissions and rejects symlinked journals [1.00ms]\\n\\ntest/tui-rpc-action-transport.test.ts:\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > round-trips only bounded, correlated shared-contract envelopes [1.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > dispatches through the public prompt/notify path and validates the ACK [1.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > returns typed retryable recovery for missing receiver, busy runtime, and ACK timeout [4.00ms]\\n(pass) Pi canonical UI action transport > receiver materializes notes, persists a separate idempotent ledger, and replays exactly [5.00ms]\\n\\n 32 pass\\n 0 fail\\n 163 expect() calls\\nRan 32 tests across 6 files. [616.00ms]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
