{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:21:56.225Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff057-d681-7ca1-8e4b-c5ac1bc938e5","call_id":"call_OeKey5gUjxN8QVMMrlHABcA7","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"  1071\t# Task Group: /home/diogenes/Projects/keating UI streaming, realtime A/V, and OpenUI learning flows\n  1072\tscope: Keating Storybook-led UI cleanup, image/animation/code streaming previews, provider capability tiers, live-session fixes, and OpenUI study-plan architecture.\n  1073\tapplies_to: cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating; reuse_rule=reuse for Keating web UI/runtime work; treat API-backed realtime and chat-renderer coverage as unverified unless separately exercised.\n  1074\t\n  1075\t## Task 1: Clean learning UI and add image, animation, and code streaming previews\n  1076\t\n  1077\t### rollout_summary_files\n  1078\t\n  1079\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/08/01/rollout-2026-08-01T17-01-40-019fbf21-f09f-7430-9d67-c1267e8285ed.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-31T08:46:26+00:00, thread_id=019fbf21-f09f-7430-9d67-c1267e8285ed, partial; chat code blocks remain unwired)\n  1080\t\n  1081\t### keywords\n  1082\t\n  1083\t- Storybook, negative-space, QuizRenderer, QuestionRenderer, image_generation.partial_image, partial_images, image-stream.ts, toolcall_delta, tool-arg-stream.ts, RunnableCodeBlock, NodePod\n  1084\t\n  1085\t## Task 2: Model realtime capability tiers and deploy live-session fixes\n  1086\t\n  1087\t### rollout_summary_files\n  1088\t\n  1089\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T21-23-32-019fb5c4-fa04-7ce2-8e3a-42b93aef3ba2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-30T18:48:44+00:00, thread_id=019fb5c4-fa04-7ce2-8e3a-42b93aef3ba2, success; real API calls unverified)\n  1090\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T22-32-08-019fb603-c694-75c2-8eb0-60484a5fca94.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-31T02:48:49+00:00, thread_id=019fb603-c694-75c2-8eb0-60484a5fca94, success; dirty worktree)\n  1091\t\n  1092\t### keywords\n  1093\t\n  1094\t- gemini-live, gpt-realtime, WebRTC, sampled JPEG, AudioWorklet, StandaloneLiveAgentBridge, Railway, keating.help/live, zero-gain node\n  1095\t\n  1096\t## Task 3: Integrate provider-backed Live mode into the chat composer\n  1097\t\n  1098\t### rollout_summary_files\n  1099\t\n  1100\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/08/03/rollout-2026-08-03T19-27-15-019fc9f3-f0bd-7610-8e75-4eb054f28dd1.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-03T23:51:07+00:00, thread_id=019fc9f3-f0bd-7610-8e75-4eb054f28dd1, success; deterministic and browser UI checks passed, real provider audio unverified)\n  1101\t\n  1102\t### keywords\n  1103\t\n  1104\t- AssistantChatPanel, SpeechComposerControl, LiveVoiceOverlay, live-transcript.ts, createPortal, preserveLiveConversation, Gemini Live, OpenAI Realtime, MediaStream has no audio track, WebMCP\n  1105\t\n  1106\t## Task 4: Add open-question Storybook states, linked StudyPlans, and Keating 2.8.0 release\n  1107\t\n  1108\t### rollout_summary_files\n  1109\t\n  1110\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating, rollout_path=/home/diogenes/.codex/sessions/2026/07/30/rollout-2026-07-30T03-19-58-019fb1e4-eee4-7662-ba3a-fb1eef03df30.jsonl, updated_at=2026-07-30T18:00:16+00:00, thread_id=019fb1e4-eee4-7662-ba3a-fb1eef03df30, partial; GitHub release succeeded, npm authorization failed)\n  1111\t\n  1112\t### keywords\n  1113\t\n  1114\t- OpenTextQuestion, OpenQuestionsSubmitted, StudyPlanLink, relatedPlans, dependsOn, studyPlanAnchorId, v2.8.0, npm E404, npm whoami\n  1115\t\n  1116\t## User preferences\n  1117\t\n  1118\t- components had “too much redundant text” and “too many boxes within boxes” -> favor one primary frame, lighter separators, fewer labels/counters, and whitespace-driven grouping; use Storybook/screenshots for diagnosis [Task 1]\n  1119\t- image streaming should provide a better preview -> show partial visual output and minimize metadata chrome [Task 1]\n  1120\t- Gemini Live is full audio/video duplex while GPT Realtime is audio duplex with image input -> model/test capability tiers instead of hardcoding provider assumptions [Task 2]\n  1121\t- when asked to “fix these issues and then deploy the code” -> implement, deterministically validate, deploy, poll to success, and perform public smoke checks [Task 2]\n  1122\t- Live should be “activatable in chat” like “chatgpt live or gemini live” -> provide one-click in-context entry rather than requiring navigation to `/live`; preserve unrelated dirty-worktree edits during integration [Task 3]\n  1123\t- study plans should have “at least two layers,” detail, and links between plans -> render explicit navigable stable-plan relationships, not prose-only references [Task 4]\n  1124\t\n  1125\t## Reusable knowledge\n  1126\t\n  1127\t- Storybook runs from `web` on port 6006; regenerate Panda styles with `bun run panda`. OpenAI partial image SSE uses `stream: true`, `partial_images: 2`, and `image_generation.partial_image` events with `b64_json`; retain JSON fallback for non-SSE providers [Task 1]\n  1128\t- Extract incomplete animation argument strings through `toolcall_delta`; render incomplete HTML sandboxed without scripts. `RunnableCodeBlock` works for `MarkdownBlock` consumers, but the chat `pre` handler still needs wiring for chat code execution [Task 1]\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"a253b762-0ccd-4d5b-9bfc-adadeef56bed"}}}
