{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:25:29.310Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff05b-16de-77f1-af13-a93a4a8dbf4b","call_id":"call_zzESBm7pJj18pCVSePtmbcXJ","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"6e1cc7\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.2913672489999999,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":708,\"output\":\"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\\n\\ntest/runtime-tool-policy.test.ts:\\n(pass) surface-specific Pi tool policy > keeps OpenTUI read-only until it has a confirmed mutation protocol [1.00ms]\\n(pass) surface-specific Pi tool policy > retains full code tools on the exact-session classic Pi handoff\\n\\ntest/tui-product-surfaces.test.ts:\\n(pass) OpenTUI Library > previews text, exports a copy, and moves deletion to recoverable project trash [7.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > discovers generated cards, labels estimated topic urgency, and persists canonical SRS ratings [9.00ms]\\n(pass) OpenTUI Review > surfaces a corrupt schedule without overwriting it\\n(pass) OpenTUI Settings > maps real RPC settings while keeping code augmentation capability truthful [1.00ms]\\n\\ntest/config.test.ts:\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig with missing file returns DEFAULT_KEATING_CONFIG [1.00ms]\\nWarning: keating.config.json is invalid and will be ignored. Falling back to defaults. Error: JSON Parse error: Unexpected identifier \\\"not\\\"\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig with invalid JSON returns DEFAULT_KEATING_CONFIG\\n(pass) ALWAYS: ensureConfig creates the default config and loadKeatingConfig reads it\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig includes bounded model-agnostic API retry defaults [1.00ms]\\n(pass) ALWAYS: default Pi provider uses OpenAI with the latest default model\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig migrates legacy google-gemini-cli provider\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig preserves sanitized Pi package sources when present\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig preserves valid overrides, defaults missing fields [32.00ms]\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig sanitizes invalid runtimePreference to default [1.00ms]\\n(pass) ALWAYS: loadKeatingConfig sanitizes non-positive traceTopLearners to default [9.00ms]\\n(pass) ALWAYS: mergePiDefaults with empty args injects all defaults [1.00ms]\\n(pass) ALWAYS: mergePiDefaults preserves explicit user overrides\\n(pass) ALWAYS: mergePiDefaults never duplicates flags [2.00ms]\\n\\ntest/package.test.ts:\\n(pass) all package manifests share the same version [1.00ms]\\n(pass) source files that embed the version are in sync with package.json\\n(pass) npm package manifest includes only the CLI launcher from bin\\n(pass) runtime discovery finds Keating's bundled pi coding agent [751.99ms]\\n(pass) dotenv startup output is quiet unless Keating debug is enabled [145.00ms]\\n(pass) shell syncs configured Pi packages into Keating's isolated Pi settings [38.00ms]\\nNo credentials found for \\\"google\\\". Using configured openai credentials instead.\\n(pass) shell falls back from unauthenticated Google default to configured OpenAI credentials [34.00ms]\\n(pass) shell opens and reports actionable in-TUI credential setup when no supported provider is configured [36.00ms]\\n\\n 27 pass\\n 0 fail\\n 1978 expect() calls\\nRan 27 tests across 4 files. [1330.00ms]\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
