{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:27:43.361Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The session audit uncovered a second real integration bug: the OpenTUI runtime writes sessions under the project’s `.keating` session directory, but the Sessions browser was listing Pi’s default global directory. That can show the wrong conversations. I’m correcting the browser to use the exact same project-scoped directory as the active RPC runtime before continuing fork/clone acceptance.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:27:43.361Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7af91dd9a081909ff8ceca04b16336","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The session audit uncovered a second real integration bug: the OpenTUI runtime writes sessions under the project’s `.keating` session directory, but the Sessions browser was listing Pi’s default global directory. That can show the wrong conversations. I’m correcting the browser to use the exact same project-scoped directory as the active RPC runtime before continuing fork/clone acceptance."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
