{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:37:40.743Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The remaining acceptance risk is no longer the renderer itself; it is proving those renderers and controls in the real built terminal. I found and fixed two runtime-only gaps during that sweep: Sessions had been looking in Pi’s global directory instead of the project’s `.keating/sessions`, and asynchronous provider failures could clear a draft after the RPC initially accepted it. Both now have focused tests; I’m validating them in the actual PTY.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:37:40.744Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7afb73245881909a13e99747571164","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The remaining acceptance risk is no longer the renderer itself; it is proving those renderers and controls in the real built terminal. I found and fixed two runtime-only gaps during that sweep: Sessions had been looking in Pi’s global directory instead of the project’s `.keating/sessions`, and asynchronous provider failures could clear a draft after the RPC initially accepted it. Both now have focused tests; I’m validating them in the actual PTY."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:37:42.045Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7afb74b2b081908ecbe75aa04dcafb","status":"completed","call_id":"call_TXVzr4XtpGGhRV3MSk3edpfK","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd:\"rtk proxy env -u OPENAI_API_KEY -u ANTHROPIC_API_KEY -u GEMINI_API_KEY TMPDIR=/home/diogenes/Projects/keating/.keating/tmp KEATING_TUI_ASCII=1 NO_COLOR=1 COLUMNS=80 LINES=24 node /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/bin/keating.js tui /sessions\",\n  workdir:\"/tmp/keating-t2-session.Jqs3Sf\",\n  tty:true,\n  yield_time_ms:2000,\n  max_output_tokens:4000\n}); text(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
