{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:40:07.421Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7afc05516c8190833ad10d58de7678","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1RsCW4ddhwGVV5beNMTAV7PP","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rtk grep -n \\\"Settings reads\\\\|renewed focused\\\\|Acceptance status remains\\\\|The `/shell` handoff\\\\|T1 |\\\" docs/plans/cross-platform-parity-execution.md docs/plans/cross-platform-parity-baseline.md\",workdir:\"/home/diogenes/Projects/keating\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:3000}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:40:07.581Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_019ff068-7d9d-7771-95e8-2b30fbca6c96","call_id":"call_1RsCW4ddhwGVV5beNMTAV7PP","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"/bin/bash: line 1: /shell: No such file or directory\n1382 matches in 2F:\n\n[file] docs/plans/cross-platform-parity-baseline.md (241):\n     1: # Cross-platform parity baseline\n     2: \n     3: Status: P0 accepted\n     4: Observed: 2026-08-11\n     5: Reference: [build specification](cross-platform-parity-build.md) and\n     6: [execution program](cross-platform-parity-execution.md)\n     7: \n     8: ## What this baseline proves\n     9: \n    10: This is the Wave 0 inventory required by P0. It maps every required learner\n    11: capability to an explicit outcome and downstream owner, records protected\n    12: pre-existing changes, and identifies the first dependency-safe work. It does\n    13: not claim feature parity or runtime acceptance.\n    14: \n    15: Status terms in the matrix mean:\n    16: \n    17: - **Present**: source and focused checks cover the stated behavior.\n    18: - **Partial**: useful behavior exists, but the required parity outcome is not\n    19: implemented or verified.\n    20: - **Missing**: the required outcome has no implementation on that surface.\n    21: - **Unverified**: source may exist, but the required installed, rendered,\n    22: authenticated, device, or terminal path has not been exercised.\n    23: \n    24: ## Reference web capability inventory\n    25: \n  +216\n\n[file] docs/plans/cross-platform-parity-execution.md (1141):\n     1: # Cross-platform parity execution program\n     2: \n     3: Status: executable goal program\n     4: Updated: 2026-08-11\n     5: \n     6: ## Purpose\n     7: \n     8: This document defines **how an agentic `/goal` run executes and measures** the\n     9: [cross-platform parity build specification](cross-platform-parity-build.md).\n    10: It sits above individual implementation plans. Its responsibility is to read\n    11: the specification, discover the real repository/runtime state, schedule ready\n    12: work, verify evidence, and decide whether the overall goal is complete.\n    13: \n    14: The task graph is not a checklist whose boxes can be trusted indefinitely.\n    15: Every `/goal` run revalidates drift-prone evidence before reporting progress.\n    16: \n    17: ## Goal declaration\n    18: \n    19: ```text\n    20: GOAL cross-platform-parity\n    21: \n    22: OBJECTIVE\n    23: Implement and verify the build specified by:\n    24: docs/plans/cross-platform-parity-build.md\n    25: \n  +1116\n\n... +1332\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"336fceb4-26f3-465e-89fc-cad66edcf467"}}}
