{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:42:15.156Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The execution-graph skill confirms D2 is the next safe tranche. I’m also using the requested low-effort subagent for a fresh, read-only D2 gap audit; the previous audit is stale because permissions, OAuth handoff, packaged persistence, and installed-window checks have since changed. I’ll keep the immediate critical path local and use the audit only to avoid duplicating already-completed desktop work.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
