{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:46:39.247Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019ff06e-778f-7290-8e02-fad7894bfe37","author":"/root/desktop_credential_vault","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/desktop_credential_vault\nPayload:\nImplemented the D2 credential-vault foundation.\n\n- New: `desktop/src/credential-vault.ts`\n- New: `desktop/test/credential-vault.test.ts`\n\nChecks passed:\n\n- Focused vault tests: 7 passing, 79 assertions\n- `desktop` TypeScript check passed\n- Scoped `git diff --check` passed\n- `vet` was invoked immediately but remains blocked by the existing repository-wide dirty-tree `DiffApplicationError`.\n\nIntegration contract: construct `CredentialVault({ path, codec })`, where `codec` implements Electron-compatible `isEncryptionAvailable()`, `encryptString()`, and `decryptString()`. The module is Electron-import-free and exposes async `get/set/delete/keys/has/clear`."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
