{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:50:39.837Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019ff072-2359-7510-a1ef-6910923855fb","call_id":"call_4n0PbNbSTsFVRT4Y19iu6MLh","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 15.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---0---\nexit=undefined\nanalyzing /home/diogenes/Projects/keating (relative to HEAD)\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---1---\nexit=1\nbun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\n\nweb/src/test/p2p-storage-backend.test.ts:\n(pass) desktop hybrid storage boundary > routes all provider and OAuth credentials away from replicated P2P storage [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop hybrid storage boundary > continues routing learner data through the P2P backend\n73 | \t\tprivate readonly credentials: KeatingCredentialBridge | undefined = detectedCredentialBridge(),\n74 | \t) {}\n75 | \n76 | \tprivate credentialBridge(): KeatingCredentialBridge {\n77 | \t\tif (!this.credentials) {\n78 | \t\t\tthrow new Error(\"Secure desktop credential storage is unavailable. Restart Keating or use Settings to recover.\");\n                  ^\nerror: Secure desktop credential storage is unavailable. Restart Keating or use Settings to recover.\n      at credentialBridge (/home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/src/lib/p2p-storage-backend.ts:78:14)\n      at set (/home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/src/lib/p2p-storage-backend.ts:93:16)\n      at <anonymous> (/home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/src/test/p2p-storage-backend.test.ts:59:26)\n(fail) desktop hybrid storage boundary > fails closed instead of falling back to P2P when the secure bridge is missing\n(pass) desktop hybrid storage boundary > rejects provider-key writes through the generic transaction path [1.00ms]\n\nweb/src/test/oauth.test.ts:\nWarning: Please use the `legacy` build in Node.js environments.\n\n# Unhandled error between tests\n-------------------------------\n10147 | const MIN_FONT_SIZE = 16;\n10148 | const MAX_FONT_SIZE = 100;\n10149 | const EXECUTION_TIME = 15;\n10150 | const EXECUTION_STEPS = 10;\n10151 | const FULL_CHUNK_HEIGHT = 16;\n10152 | const SCALE_MATRIX = new DOMMatrix();\n                                 ^\nReferenceError: DOMMatrix is not defined\n      at /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/node_modules/pdfjs-dist/build/pdf.mjs:10152:26\n      at loadAndEvaluateModule (2:1)\n-------------------------------\n\n\n 3 pass\n 2 fail\n 1 error\n 11 expect() calls\nRan 5 tests across 2 files. [503.00ms]\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---2---\nexit=undefined\n$ bun run panda\n$ panda codegen && panda cssgen --outfile styled-system/styles.css\n✔️ `styled-system/css`: the css function to author styles\n✔️ `styled-system/tokens`: the css variables and js function to query your tokens\n✔️ `styled-system/patterns`: functions to implement and apply common layout patterns\n✔️ `styled-system/recipes`: functions to create multi-variant styles\n✔️ `styled-system/jsx`: styled jsx elements for react\n\n\n🐼 info [css] /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/styled-system/styles.css\n🐼 info [hrtime] Successfully extracted css from 503 file(s) ✨ (301.73ms)\n$ tsc --noEmit\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
