{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:50:49.883Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The secure routing behavior is correct; the new focused test exposed a testing-shape detail, not a product defect: missing secure storage fails synchronously before any P2P call, while the assertion expected an already-created rejected promise. I’m correcting that assertion. The unrelated direct OAuth test import also requires the web suite’s browser shims (`DOMMatrix`); I’ll rely on the canonical web task for that coverage rather than misreporting the raw import failure as OAuth behavior.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
