{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:59:45.562Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The first packaged run exposed a separate real lifecycle defect that unit tests missed: after the renderer was disposed, the two-second P2P stats timer kept attempting sends until process exit. I’m closing that seam by treating `webContents` destruction as renderer cleanup and checking it before every event send; the credential IPC receives the same lifecycle boundary.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:59:45.562Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7b009ff02c8190bccdf0631b7c5d0c","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The first packaged run exposed a separate real lifecycle defect that unit tests missed: after the renderer was disposed, the two-second P2P stats timer kept attempting sends until process exit. I’m closing that seam by treating `webContents` destruction as renderer cleanup and checking it before every event send; the credential IPC receives the same lifecycle boundary."}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T10:59:51.554Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02b258e8e56f2fcd016a7b00a17fb08190b3a16249a651a96b","status":"completed","call_id":"call_eWVEySgt7rXE5sA96t3bM4ke","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/desktop/src/ipc.ts\\n@@\\n \\tipcMain.handle(P2P_IPC_CHANNEL, handle);\\n \\tconst send = () => {\\n-\\t\\tif (stopped || window.isDestroyed()) return;\\n+\\t\\tif (stopped || window.isDestroyed() || window.webContents.isDestroyed()) return;\\n@@\\n \\t\\tstopped = true;\\n \\t\\tclearInterval(interval);\\n \\t\\twindow.removeListener(\\\"closed\\\", cleanup);\\n+\\t\\tif (!window.webContents.isDestroyed()) window.webContents.removeListener(\\\"destroyed\\\", cleanup);\\n@@\\n \\tactiveCleanup = cleanup;\\n \\twindow.once(\\\"closed\\\", cleanup);\\n+\\twindow.webContents.once(\\\"destroyed\\\", cleanup);\\n \\treturn cleanup;\\n }\\n*** Update File: /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/desktop/src/credential-ipc.ts\\n@@\\n \\t\\tif (stopped) return;\\n \\t\\tstopped = true;\\n \\t\\twindow.removeListener(\\\"closed\\\", cleanup);\\n+\\t\\tif (!window.webContents.isDestroyed()) window.webContents.removeListener(\\\"destroyed\\\", cleanup);\\n@@\\n \\tactiveCleanup = cleanup;\\n \\twindow.once(\\\"closed\\\", cleanup);\\n+\\twindow.webContents.once(\\\"destroyed\\\", cleanup);\\n \\treturn cleanup;\\n }\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
