{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:00:21.016Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019ff07b-0198-7652-bfed-e0e4a912db5c","call_id":"call_kRUDic2Uv2QE1EK8MrDWm2rO","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 12.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---0---\nexit=0\n$ tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---1---\nexit=0\nbun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\n\ntest/credential-service.test.ts:\n(pass) DesktopCredentialService > keeps new credentials exclusively in the secure vault [1.00ms]\n(pass) DesktopCredentialService > migrates legacy credentials only after secure persistence succeeds\n(pass) DesktopCredentialService > preserves legacy work when secure storage is unavailable\n(pass) DesktopCredentialService > migrates listing and applies delete, has, and clear to both stores\n(pass) DesktopCredentialService > refuses malformed legacy credential values without deleting them\n\ntest/credential-vault.test.ts:\n(pass) CredentialVault > round-trips across restart, deletes, and clears provider/OAuth credentials [12.00ms]\n(pass) CredentialVault > serializes concurrent writes without losing credentials [26.00ms]\n(pass) CredentialVault > persists only versioned ciphertext with an owner-only atomic replacement [1.00ms]\n(pass) CredentialVault > fails closed when secure OS encryption is unavailable\n(pass) CredentialVault > rejects invalid credential ids before reading or writing\n(pass) CredentialVault > rejects corruption and unsupported versions without overwriting the vault [1.00ms]\n(pass) CredentialVault > rejects symlinked or non-owner-readable vaults without replacing them\n\ntest/nitro-runtime.test.ts:\n(pass) desktop Nitro runtime paths > uses a read-only packaged resource and user-data-only mutable state\n(pass) desktop Nitro runtime paths > uses the staged dist/nitro tree while developing\n(pass) desktop Nitro runtime paths > sets a loopback-only child environment without putting state in resources\n(pass) Nitro readiness > retries bounded readiness probes until the local server is healthy [1.00ms]\n(pass) Nitro readiness > fails after the bounded readiness deadline\n(pass) Nitro shutdown > escalates only after graceful shutdown exceeds its deadline\n\ntest/permissions.test.ts:\n(pass) desktop permission policy > allows only camera and microphone from the owning main frame [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop permission policy > installs check, request, and explicit screen-capture denial handlers\n\ntest/security-lifecycle.test.ts:\n(pass) desktop navigation policy > keeps the preload-bearing window on its app origin and externalizes only safe links [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop navigation policy > corrects secret file permissions where the operating system supports POSIX modes\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > rejects unknown RPC methods, payload cycles, excess depth, and replayed ids [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > closes late startup resources before an in-flight shutdown settles [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > waits for an already-starting Nitro runtime before shutdown settles\n(pass) desktop lifecycle > reuses the process store across macOS reactivation and closes each resource once [1.00ms]\n\n 26 pass\n 0 fail\n 159 expect() calls\nRan 26 tests across 5 files. [102.00ms]\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---2---\nexit=1\nanalyzing /home/diogenes/Projects/keating (relative to HEAD)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/home/diogenes/.local/share/uv/tools/verify-everything/lib64/python3.13/site-packages/vet/imbue_tools/repo_utils/diff_utils.py\", line 54, in _apply_diff_to_files\n    result = subprocess.run(\n        (\"git\", \"apply\", \"--verbose\", patch_file_path),\n    ...<4 lines>...\n        check=True,\n    )\n  File \"/usr/lib64/python3.13/subprocess.py\", line 577, in run\n    raise CalledProcessError(retcode, process.args,\n                             output=stdout, stderr=stderr)\nsubprocess.CalledProcessError: Command '(