{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:10:19.301Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019ff084-22a5-7293-8f8b-bd9aa933b15f","author":"/root/desktop_oauth_callback","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/desktop_oauth_callback\nPayload:\nImplemented the isolated OAuth loopback receiver foundation.\n\n- New: `desktop/src/oauth-callback.ts`\n- New: `desktop/test/oauth-callback.test.ts`\n- No other files changed.\n\nContract: `startOAuthCallbackReceiver({ onCallback, port? })` returns either a receiver or actionable `{ action: \"manual-paste\" }` unavailability. Successful callbacks provide canonical `{ url, code, state }`; default redirect is `http://127.0.0.1:1455/auth/callback`.\n\nVerified:\n\n- Focused OAuth tests: 7 passed / 29 assertions (with required loopback socket access).\n- Desktop typecheck passed.\n- `vet` run after each logical change; latest completed cleanly.\n- Diff checks passed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
