{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:12:55.875Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The low-effort audit found three concrete parity defects, so I’m correcting the claims and code now:\n\n- Web Mermaid accepted more grammars than the mobile/shared contract, despite documentation claiming a fixed twelve.\n- OpenUI JSON fence aliases differed between web/desktop and mobile.\n- Web Mermaid caching ignored full-source identity and live theme changes.\n\nI’m assigning the Mermaid and OpenUI fixes to separate Terra-high workers with non-overlapping ownership while I finish and validate the desktop OAuth bridge. Luna is still not available in this environment, so its required review gate remains explicitly pending rather than being substituted.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
