{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:13:34.771Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019ff087-1e33-7ea1-8676-9b854a20401e","call_id":"call_tGo6msVVeHCQ6P9iVOMU6cGH","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 12.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---RESULT 1 exit=0---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\n\ndesktop/test/security-lifecycle.test.ts:\n(pass) desktop navigation policy > keeps the preload-bearing window on its app origin and externalizes only safe links [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop navigation policy > corrects secret file permissions where the operating system supports POSIX modes\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > rejects unknown RPC methods, payload cycles, excess depth, and replayed ids [2.00ms]\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > closes late startup resources before an in-flight shutdown settles [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop IPC limits > waits for an already-starting Nitro runtime before shutdown settles [1.00ms]\n(pass) desktop lifecycle > reuses the process store across macOS reactivation and closes each resource once\n(pass) desktop lifecycle > waits for asynchronous renderer cleanup before shutdown completes [1.00ms]\n\n 7 pass\n 0 fail\n 29 expect() calls\nRan 7 tests across 1 file. [16.00ms]\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---RESULT 2 exit=1---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"bun test v1.3.13 (bf2e2cec)\n\nweb/src/test/oauth.test.ts:\nWarning: Please use the `legacy` build in Node.js environments.\n\n# Unhandled error between tests\n-------------------------------\n10147 | const MIN_FONT_SIZE = 16;\n10148 | const MAX_FONT_SIZE = 100;\n10149 | const EXECUTION_TIME = 15;\n10150 | const EXECUTION_STEPS = 10;\n10151 | const FULL_CHUNK_HEIGHT = 16;\n10152 | const SCALE_MATRIX = new DOMMatrix();\n                                 ^\nReferenceError: DOMMatrix is not defined\n      at /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/node_modules/pdfjs-dist/build/pdf.mjs:10152:26\n      at loadAndEvaluateModule (2:1)\n-------------------------------\n\n\n 0 pass\n 1 fail\n 1 error\nRan 1 test across 1 file. [557.00ms]\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---RESULT 3 exit=0---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"$ tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---RESULT 4 exit=0---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"$ bun run panda\n$ panda codegen && panda cssgen --outfile styled-system/styles.css\n✔️ `styled-system/css`: the css function to author styles\n✔️ `styled-system/tokens`: the css variables and js function to query your tokens\n✔️ `styled-system/patterns`: functions to implement and apply common layout patterns\n✔️ `styled-system/recipes`: functions to create multi-variant styles\n✔️ `styled-system/jsx`: styled jsx elements for react\n\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│             @pandacss/dev update check failed              │\n│            Try running with sudo or get access             │\n│            to the local update config store via            │\n│ sudo chown -R $USER:$(id -gn $USER) /home/diogenes/.config │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n🐼 info [css] /home/diogenes/Projects/keating/web/styled-system/styles.css\n🐼 info [hrtime] Successfully extracted css from 503 file(s) ✨ (280.62ms)\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│             @pandacss/dev update check failed              │\n│            Try running with sudo or get access             │\n│            to the local update config store via            │\n│ sudo chown -R $USER:$(id -gn $USER) /home/diogenes/.config │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n$ tsc --noEmit\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
