{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:19:27.419Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019ff08c-7fbb-72d1-9e0c-abe5e42d3ec2","author":"/root/mermaid_policy_parity","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/mermaid_policy_parity\nPayload:\nImplemented Mermaid parity hardening.\n\n- Web only accepts the shared 12-grammar Mermaid subset.\n- Unsupported grammars show the existing visible error fallback.\n- Cache uses full source + theme, avoiding prefix collisions.\n- Mermaid rerenders when the document dark class changes.\n- Added targeted shared/web tests.\n\nVerified: 14 focused tests passed, both relevant TypeScript checks passed, and `git diff --check` passed. Vet exited successfully but produced only its initial analysis line."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
