{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:20:00.655Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019ff08d-018f-7972-ae77-69bf0cdc5eea","author":"/root/openui_alias_parity","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/openui_alias_parity\nPayload:\nOpenUI JSON fence parity is complete.\n\n- Web/desktop now accepts `keating-ui`, `ui-document`, `openui-json`, and `openui` JSON fences.\n- `openui` / `openui-lang` remain the only source-capable labels.\n- Split JSON fences remain hidden/incomplete until closed.\n- Malformed JSON aliases yield inert document errors, never source compilation.\n\nVerified: 18 OpenUI segment tests / 197 assertions passed; web TypeScript check passed. `vet` ran after each edit without findings."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"93ef4b9d-3191-46b6-a2c2-3b39e130995b"}}}
