{"timestamp":"2026-08-11T11:20:14.939Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The Mermaid worker’s policy change exposed a real compatibility regression during coordinator review: Keating’s own map generator emits `graph TD`, while the new shared detector initially accepted only `flowchart TD`. I’m fixing that at the shared contract and mobile validator so the safe allowlist covers diagrams Keating itself produces, including semicolon-form headers and harmless leading comments, while still rejecting executable initialization directives and unsupported grammars.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
